<p. 62b> śrīsiddhikālikāyai ||

atha vakṣya mahādevyā stotraṃ sarvajña bhāṣitaṃ |
paṭhanādbhakti yuktena śakrasyaiśvaryamāpnuyāt ||

brahmaṇā brahmaśabdena stutātvaṃ parameśvari |
icchāśaktiṃ parāṃ māyāṃ siddhikālīṃ namāmyaham ||

pālanāya jagaddevī viṣṇunātvaṃ parāparāṃ |
saṃstutājñānaśabdena siddhikālīṃ namāmyaham ||

aparāṃ kālarudrena saṃhārārthaṃ stutā śive |
tvāṃ kriyāṃ rudraśabdena siddhikālīṃ namāmyaham ||

īśvarena layārthatvāṃ stutāsicitkalevyaye |
<p. 63a> kalātītāṃ mahāmāyāṃ siddhikālīṃ namāmyaham ||

sadā śivena satataṃ stutātvaṃ parameśvari |
anugrahāya lokānāṃ siddhikālīṃ namāmyaham ||

idaṃ stotraṃ paṭhedyastu bhaktiyuktena cetasā |
tasmaidadyāt siddhikālī sarvasiddhirna saṃśayaḥ ||

yaḥ ślokapañcakaṃ devī nityaṃ manasi dhārayet |
sarvajñatvaṃ labheddevi siddhikālī praśādataḥ ||

yāmāsādya mayā devi prāptā siddhiranekadhā |
brahmāpi sṛṣṭikarttātvaṃ viṣṇuḥ syāt pālako bhavet ||

<p. 63b> saṃhāra kṛtkālarudra īśvarolaya kṛtsadā |
vahunātra kimuktena sā devī dhyāna mātrata ||

sajīvanneva muktiḥ syā satya satyaṃ mayoditam ||

[iti śrītridaśaḍāmare śrīsiddhikālī stotraṃ saṃpūrṇaṃ] || 

thva stotralivaṅamahne nā otha nathva stotra thana cosyaṃ tayā ||




śrīsiddhikālikāyai ||

