<p. 65a> evaṃ dhyātvā mahākālīṃ sūryalakṣaṃ japenmanuḥ |
kamalaistaddaśāṃśena juhuyāddhavyavāhano ||

karpuramiśritaistoyaistaddaśāṃśena tarpayet |
abhiṣekaṃ daśāṃśena brāhmaṇāṃstaddaśāṃśataḥ |

bhojayenmadhuraiḥ miṣṭaiḥ pāyasānnaiḥ svaśaktitaḥ |
tato japenmahākālīṃ mūlādhāre vibhāvayan ||

trisaṃdhyaṃ meka cittena niścalenāntarātmanaḥ |
varṣamekena labhataṃ mahadaiśvaryamuttamam ||

eṣā vidyā mahāvidyā sarvatantreṣu gopitā |
mayā te kathitā devi na deyā yasya kasyacit ||

